# BUGS

The hot-reload host is a template, not a call; a release build links the image into it, by hand for now. `libvxui.so`'s exports are written beside it, but held to no list until libvx's level 2 is frozen (ADR-0056).
The UI has labels and buttons in one column, no other widgets or layouts, and no keyboard focus; the theme's colours are vx-magic's, whatever theme the window is drawn in.
